		{
			x: -2.0d
			y: 0.0d
			subtitle: "Buy, Sell, Trade, Profit"
			description: [
				"&7As you've seen looking around the FOP DLC Shop and our TFB Shop Tablet, Bandit, theres two major currency systems : Vault Coins and Ferret Dollars."
				""
				"&7Vault Coins the FOP base currency. You find them in Vaults as standard loot, and can 'digitalize' items to get a tiny amount of them."
				""
				"&7Ferret Dollars are The Ferret Business' currency. You mostly get it by doing stuff in this Q.U.E.S.T. Tablet, and sending stuff to us back home with the TFB Shipping System."
				""
				"&7Did you notice there's other ways to earn both Vault Coins and Ferret Dollars?"
				""
				"&7Thought so. How about I turn this section of the Q.U.E.S.T. Tablet into instructions of ALL the ways to earn money? Sound good?"
			]
			dependencies: ["29003EE631630364"]
